{"version":1,"content":"<p>圍繞「字節時間」的公共爭論仍未停息。著名大V胡錫進發文，批評抖音集團副總裁李亮「很失大公司風度」。11月4日，李亮再度發文，回應知名自媒體人秦朔和胡錫進。抖音集團副總裁李亮表示，原本他和秦朔的爭論打算到此為止，但看到胡錫進對自己的批評登上熱搜，同時微信內大量推送攻擊自己的文章之後，他認為有必要把想法説清楚。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584980.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.115439+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_hash":"6a80cda173a9de97b2e96e5c876bedf2f2563988df0c29a920c0a67d58b22873","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}